GD: image creation and manipulation with libgd of the package az (PNG,
JPEG, WebP, FreeType).

The module gd of PHP 7.4 for php74 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20190902/gd.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php74/conf.d, its headers in
include/php74/php/ext/gd.
